[
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_qin_haoxuan_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "自己资质虽然不如张狂，但胜在有百毒不侵的小蛇，或许可以附身进那绝仙毒谷",
    "start_offset": 1557,
    "end_offset": 1592,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_qin_haoxuan_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "秦浩轩恻隐之心大动，主动和他打着招呼",
    "start_offset": 4022,
    "end_offset": 4040,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_zhang_kuang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "如果我混到掌教位置，岂不是翔龙国护国仙师",
    "start_offset": 14,
    "end_offset": 34,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_wucai_xiaoshe_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "自己资质虽然不如张狂，但胜在有百毒不侵的小蛇",
    "start_offset": 1557,
    "end_offset": 1579,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_xu_tunhu_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "我入门三十年，只突破仙苗境，长出十一片仙叶",
    "start_offset": 1189,
    "end_offset": 1210,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_zhao_jialong_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "赵师兄是我们这一辈中翘楚，花了三十多年时间开了二十二片仙叶",
    "start_offset": 1211,
    "end_offset": 1240,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_zhang_yang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "张狂和张扬二人洋溢着热情的笑容，已经笼络了好几个少年",
    "start_offset": 3763,
    "end_offset": 3789,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_wandu_mozun_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "魔道老祖之一的万毒魔尊一怒之下自爆",
    "start_offset": 495,
    "end_offset": 512,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_wandu_mozun_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "万毒魔尊自爆后，毒气蔓延了大半个大屿山，形成绝仙毒谷",
    "start_offset": 604,
    "end_offset": 630,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_li_jing_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "他是翔龙国当今皇帝最疼爱的三皇子李靖",
    "start_offset": 3396,
    "end_offset": 3414,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_li_jing_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "李靖，请教兄台尊姓大名",
    "start_offset": 4225,
    "end_offset": 4236,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_xu_yu_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "怯生生地说道：“徐……徐羽……”",
    "start_offset": 4095,
    "end_offset": 4111,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_xiao_yu_shan_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "他附在小蛇身上，也曾探索过小屿山深处，那里都危险无比，极易迷路",
    "start_offset": 713,
    "end_offset": 744,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_da_yu_shan_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "现在的大屿山只是当初大屿山的三分之一",
    "start_offset": 631,
    "end_offset": 649,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_da_yu_shan_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "大屿山，翔龙国第一宗门所在地，山势巍峨，连绵起伏",
    "start_offset": 1775,
    "end_offset": 1799,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_huangdi_feng_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "主峰黄帝峰直插云霄",
    "start_offset": 1811,
    "end_offset": 1820,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_huangdi_feng_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "黄帝峰禁止骑马上山",
    "start_offset": 2298,
    "end_offset": 2307,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_juexian_dugu_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "最接近数十万年前仙魔大战之一的战场——绝仙毒谷",
    "start_offset": 141,
    "end_offset": 164,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_juexian_dugu_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "万毒魔尊自爆后，毒气蔓延了大半个大屿山，形成绝仙毒谷",
    "start_offset": 604,
    "end_offset": 630,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_juexian_dugu_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "偌大的绝仙毒谷从来只有进没有出",
    "start_offset": 682,
    "end_offset": 697,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_tongtian_ti_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "一条蜿蜒崎岖却气势磅礴的通天梯从峰顶直通山脚",
    "start_offset": 1821,
    "end_offset": 1843,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_tongtian_ti_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "通天梯的尽头是太初宝殿",
    "start_offset": 1902,
    "end_offset": 1913,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_taichu_baodian_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "通天梯的尽头是太初宝殿，整个翔龙国人心驰神往的仙家重地",
    "start_offset": 1902,
    "end_offset": 1929,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_taichu_baodian_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "如果不是太初教弟子，凡夫俗子即便是人中之龙的皇帝，一辈子中也只有在受册封时能进一次",
    "start_offset": 1930,
    "end_offset": 1971,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_banshan_ting_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "半山亭其实是一条长长的走廊，更是太初教的对外宣传栏",
    "start_offset": 2605,
    "end_offset": 2630,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_banshan_ting_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "在半山亭有人接待",
    "start_offset": 2441,
    "end_offset": 2449,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_taichu_jiao_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "若我太初能走入绝仙毒谷",
    "start_offset": 66,
    "end_offset": 77,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_taichu_jiao_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "半山腰之上乃宗门重地，你们现在没有资格进入",
    "start_offset": 3028,
    "end_offset": 3049,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_xianglong_guo_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "他是翔龙国当今皇帝最疼爱的三皇子李靖",
    "start_offset": 3396,
    "end_offset": 3414,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_realm_zhongzhi_xiangen_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "修仙第一层种植仙根境",
    "start_offset": 1099,
    "end_offset": 1109,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_realm_xianmiao_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "突破到第二层仙苗境",
    "start_offset": 1137,
    "end_offset": 1146,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_realm_xianshu_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "突破第三层仙树境",
    "start_offset": 1250,
    "end_offset": 1258,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_realm_xianying_daoguo_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "第五层仙婴道果境",
    "start_offset": 880,
    "end_offset": 888,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_juexian_dugu_poison_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "至今修仙者进入绝仙毒谷还会被毒死",
    "start_offset": 563,
    "end_offset": 579,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_juexian_dugu_poison_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "即便是境界极高的修仙者也不敢轻易闯入",
    "start_offset": 650,
    "end_offset": 668,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_juexian_dugu_poison_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "偌大的绝仙毒谷从来只有进没有出",
    "start_offset": 682,
    "end_offset": 697,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_extreme_places_mutated_herbs_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "天地间至阴、至毒或至阳的地方，都很容易生出变异灵药",
    "start_offset": 795,
    "end_offset": 820,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_xianmiao_forty_nine_leaves_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "仙苗能生长出四十九叶，仙叶越多实力越强",
    "start_offset": 1147,
    "end_offset": 1166,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_xianmiao_forty_nine_leaves_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "生齐四十九叶后方有机会拔苗成树",
    "start_offset": 1167,
    "end_offset": 1182,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_cultivation_lifespan_breakthrough_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "一百五十年寿元耗尽后，又没有灵丹妙药延长寿元，就只有死之一途",
    "start_offset": 1259,
    "end_offset": 1289,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_cultivation_lifespan_breakthrough_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "突破到第五层仙婴道果境，再获得几百年寿元",
    "start_offset": 877,
    "end_offset": 897,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_taichu_inner_area_restriction_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "半山腰之上乃宗门重地，你们现在没有资格进入",
    "start_offset": 3028,
    "end_offset": 3049,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_taichu_inner_area_restriction_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "否则将逐出门墙永不收录",
    "start_offset": 3058,
    "end_offset": 3069,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_taichu_inner_area_restriction_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "黄帝峰禁止骑马上山",
    "start_offset": 2298,
    "end_offset": 2307,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_wandu_self_detonation_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "魔道老祖之一的万毒魔尊一怒之下自爆，毒死仙魔两道强者无数",
    "start_offset": 495,
    "end_offset": 523,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_wandu_self_detonation_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "万毒魔尊自爆后，毒气蔓延了大半个大屿山，形成绝仙毒谷",
    "start_offset": 604,
    "end_offset": 630,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_new_disciples_arrive_taichu_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "不眠不休的驱马狂奔了三天三夜后，他们终于来到大屿山山脚",
    "start_offset": 1743,
    "end_offset": 1770,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_new_disciples_arrive_taichu_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "指引秦浩轩三人在山门下登记处登记后，他与徐吞虎上山",
    "start_offset": 2360,
    "end_offset": 2385,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_qin_meets_xu_yu_li_jing_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "那就是你们今晚的住处",
    "start_offset": 3087,
    "end_offset": 3097,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_qin_meets_xu_yu_li_jing_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "怯生生地说道：“徐……徐羽……”",
    "start_offset": 4095,
    "end_offset": 4111,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_qin_meets_xu_yu_li_jing_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "李靖，请教兄台尊姓大名",
    "start_offset": 4225,
    "end_offset": 4236,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_001",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "黄长老那名废柴儿子",
    "start_offset": 1370,
    "end_offset": 1379,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_002",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "黄长老那名废柴儿子",
    "start_offset": 1370,
    "end_offset": 1379,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_003",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "咱们宗门寿元将尽的老祖宗",
    "start_offset": 863,
    "end_offset": 875,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_004",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "一名四十来岁的太初教弟子才施施然赶来",
    "start_offset": 2805,
    "end_offset": 2823,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_005",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "李靖和身边几名权贵子弟",
    "start_offset": 3559,
    "end_offset": 3570,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_006",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "那片低矮破旧的平房",
    "start_offset": 3074,
    "end_offset": 3083,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_007",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "带着两百多名新人在食堂用过膳",
    "start_offset": 2842,
    "end_offset": 2856,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_008",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "山门下登记处登记",
    "start_offset": 2368,
    "end_offset": 2376,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_009",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "有失传已久的上古灵法、魔术、还有许多能令整个修真界掀起血雨腥风的法宝",
    "start_offset": 210,
    "end_offset": 244,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_004_010",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-cecd924ed73c43a1880b24584ed49537",
    "text": "绝仙毒谷肯定孕育了许多变异灵药",
    "start_offset": 831,
    "end_offset": 846,
    "source_hash": "73b892b0cfc9f87dfe3d18dcc19fbcc63ab60cd650769ae0e557936a30633b9a"
  }
]
